
units           metal
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
atom_style      atomic

read_data       relaxed.data
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (0.016974806 0.025239891 -0.057710537) to (82.079025 81.228727 84.369711)
  3 by 2 by 5 MPI processor grid
